{"id":"claim:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism--affective-interjections-strong-emotion","revision":1,"topic":"topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism","topics":["topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism","topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism--directives"],"statement":{"en":"A set of interjections including irayapka, inunukaski, iyohaysitomare, and iramkitta express strong emotions such as surprise, pity, and annoyance.","ja":"irayapka、inunukaski、iyohaysitomare、iramkitta などの間投詞は、驚き・憐憫・当惑などの強い感情を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"specific","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["irayapka","inunukaski","iyohaysitomare","iramkitta"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0423-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism--shizunai-interjection-iramkitta","revision":1,"topic":"topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism","topics":["topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism","topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism--directives"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai, iramkitta is an interjection expressing amazement and disgust.","ja":"静内方言において、iramkitta は驚きや嫌悪を表す感動詞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"specific","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["iramkitta"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0126-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0127-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism--affective-interjections-strong-emotion","differs_in":"scope","note":"Refsing provides Shizunai-specific semantics for iramkitta, which Nakagawa lists among affective interjections expressing strong emotions."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism--shizunai-interjection-hetak-command","revision":1,"topic":"topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism","topics":["topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism","topic:discourse/interjections-ideophones-sound-symbolism--directives"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai, hetak is an interjection meaning 'well, now' and is followed by a command.","ja":"静内方言において、hetak は「さあ、どれ」を意味し、命令が後続する感動詞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"specific","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["hetak"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0126-05","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0127-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
